[^a-z] -->Not matching any lowercase chars
------- 

[^a-zA-Z0-9]
-------------> Not matching Alpha and number 

^$ ->empty line
---

 pattern1|pattern2 - any one pattern is matched ->OK

 (pattern1)(pattern2) - both pattern should match

 <pattern>+ - 1 or more times
-----------   ==  ============
 ab+c 
 ----------> abc abbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbc //OK

<pattern>{n} - n times

 ab{3}c ==> abbbc //OK 
 abc abbc abbbbc //Not-Matched

<pattern>{n,} - minimum n times maximum nolimit

ab{3,}c -->abbbc abbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbc 

ab+c same as ab{1,}c  
======================
<pattern>{n,m} - minimum n times maximum m

ab{3,5}c ==> abbbc abbbbc abbbbbc //OK
